  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for East Africa AMLCFT - Economic Crimes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECT technical assistance will aim to improve measures to prevent illicit financing from penetrating financial and commercial sectors; enforcement measures to address situations when preventative measures fall short; and to assist in FIU development, given the critical role the FIU plays in maximizing performance of preventative stakeholders; collecting financial intelligence from preventative stakeholders, analyzing it and disseminating value-added work product to enforcement stakeholders to support case development and successful prosecutions and asset recoveries. Additionally ECT will assist in promoting regional approaches and collaboration...</narrative>
  </description>
